    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Different Kind of Platformer</h2><strong>Blindsighted</strong> has the player explore levels not by sight but by touch and memory. <strong>Dying is common</strong>, but you'll remember the lay of the land each time. Learn from your mistakes!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2>Originally conceived for a <strong>Game Jam</strong> as nothing more than a demo, <strong>Blindsighted</strong> is now a full game!<br><br><strong>Features:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Lots of unique gameplay mechanics<br></li><li> Minimalist, but captivating visuals<br></li><li> Controller support<br></li><li> 4 original pieces of music<br></li><li> More than one level! (12 base levels, bonus levels added all the time.)<br></li><li> Level select with best times and best deaths<br></li><li> Optional timer and death counters<br></li><li> Accessibility features</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Different Kind of Platformer</h2><strong>Blindsighted</strong> has the player explore levels not by sight but by touch and memory. <strong>Dying is common</strong>, but you'll remember the lay of the land each time. Learn from your mistakes!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2>Originally conceived for a <strong>Game Jam</strong> as nothing more than a demo, <strong>Blindsighted</strong> is now a full game!<br><br><strong>Features:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Lots of unique gameplay mechanics<br></li><li> Minimalist, but captivating visuals<br></li><li> Controller support<br></li><li> 4 original pieces of music<br></li><li> More than one level! (12 base levels, bonus levels added all the time.)<br></li><li> Level select with best times and best deaths<br></li><li> Optional timer and death counters<br></li><li> Accessibility features</li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Navigate a platformer using only feeling and memory, each death meaning progress. With your memory illuminating your path, you'll &quot;see&quot; a little more of the level each time you attempt it.",
